    "font" : "Courier",
    "font size" : 5.349,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Take almondes, and grynde hem raw in a morter, and temper hit with wyne and a litul water, and drawe it thorgh a streynour into a goode stiff raylke into a potte, and caste thereto reysons of coraunce and grete reysons my[n]ced, dates, clowes, maces, pouder of peper, canel, saffrone agoodquantite, and salt, and sette hem over the fire, and lete al boyle togidrc a while, and alay hit up with floure of ryse or elles grated brede, and cast thereto sugur and salt, and serve hit forth in maner of mortrewes, and caste thereone pouder ginger in the dissh."
  }, {
